{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"additional_concerns\":[\"The formula depends on supplied judgments for aggregate exposure and operative designation. It does not implement a look-through or aggregation method; unresolved measurements must remain UNKNOWN.\",\"The formula's false result should be read only as absence of the two classification triggers at the assessment time. It does not establish general non-complex status or discharge disclosure and sale duties.\",\"The LAF exclusion is supported, but the separate LAF circular is not supplied. Its distinct classification rules cannot be inferred here.\"],\"checks\":[{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The circular and footnote 6 establish this scope; separate LAF rules are outside the claim.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.10bac0eaa7311ec653c12f95\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The scope requires public SFC authorisation and excludes LAFs.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"Scope: all of these conditions hold: [the fact public_sfc_authorised; it is not the case that [the fact is_laf]]\"],\"status\":\"PRESERVES\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"This circular provides guidance to management companies of funds that are authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong (Funds)6\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u4.564\"},{\"quote\":\"6 Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691\"}],\"question_hash\":\"081eed6b6dc4b643c2ba1dc9591087fbcfed74b457b2c0bb6762b340bf15cd25\",\"rationale\":\"The claim defines which Funds the typed classification question covers.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"This circular provides guidance to management companies of funds that are authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong (Funds)6\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u4.564\"},{\"quote\":\"6 Except for listed closed-ended alternative asset funds (LAFs).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u63.8691\"}],\"rationale\":\"The body and footnote expressly support the stated scope and exclusion.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}} ,{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The described channel follows from the circular itself; footnote 1 adds an investment-limit reference but is unnecessary to this classification description.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.1f03023e3fe60300a933d2fb\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The formula accepts an aggregate-exposure judgment but does not classify particular investments as direct exposure.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav: Whether the Fund's total direct and indirect exposure to private market assets amounts to at least 50% of its NAV at the assessment time, using the applicable methodology. Missing or unresolved measurement evidence leaves this fact unknown. (Boolean)\",\"Supplied classifications requiring judgment: is_laf, aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav, operative_sfc_designation. Their assessment is not implemented by this formula.\"],\"status\":\"OMITS\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"What methodology determines whether the described loans or equities count toward the aggregate exposure fact?\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"direct exposure through investments in bank or non-bank direct lending in the form of loans or equities to unlisted companies (direct exposure)\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u1.5\"},{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}],\"question_hash\":\"081eed6b6dc4b643c2ba1dc9591087fbcfed74b457b2c0bb6762b340bf15cd25\",\"rationale\":\"Identifying direct exposure informs the threshold input.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"direct exposure through investments in bank or non-bank direct lending in the form of loans or equities to unlisted companies (direct exposure)\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u1.5\"}],\"rationale\":\"The described investments are expressly identified as direct exposure.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}} ,{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The listed exposure channels are stated in the circular; no additional authority is required for this limited claim.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.30a3cb26c68a94953f4467ab\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The formula delegates exposure classification and measurement to an input fact; it does not execute the listed channel definitions.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav: Whether the Fund's total direct and indirect exposure to private market assets amounts to at least 50% of its NAV at the assessment time, using the applicable methodology. Missing or unresolved measurement evidence leaves this fact unknown. (Boolean)\",\"Supplied classifications requiring judgment: is_laf, aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav, operative_sfc_designation. Their assessment is not implemented by this formula.\"],\"status\":\"OMITS\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"What look-through and aggregation methodology supplies the threshold fact for these exposures?\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"direct exposure through investments in bank or non-bank direct lending in the form of loans or equities to unlisted companies (direct exposure)1; or indirect exposures2 including through investments in business development companies (BDCs)3, collateralised loan obligations (CLOs)4 or financial derivative instruments5.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u1.5\"}],\"question_hash\":\"081eed6b6dc4b643c2ba1dc9591087fbcfed74b457b2c0bb6762b340bf15cd25\",\"rationale\":\"The channel descriptions inform the exposure total used for classification.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"direct exposure through investments in bank or non-bank direct lending in the form of loans or equities to unlisted companies (direct exposure)1; or indirect exposures2 including through investments in business development companies (BDCs)3, collateralised loan obligations (CLOs)4 or financial derivative instruments5.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u1.5\"},{\"quote\":\"2 The examples of indirect exposures set out in paragraph 1 above are non-exhaustive, and subject to review and update by the SFC from time to time in view of market developments.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u59.7979\"}],\"rationale\":\"The circular supports the channels as examples, not a complete measurement method.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}} ,{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"Footnote 4 itself supplies the limited CLO description.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.32206590a7202ae0577c076c\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The executable rule does not determine whether a particular security is a CLO or measure its underlying exposure.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"Supplied classifications requiring judgment: is_laf, aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav, operative_sfc_designation. Their assessment is not implemented by this formula.\"],\"status\":\"OMITS\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"4 CLOs are securities backed by a pool of debt, typically leveraged loans and broadly syndicated loans, or direct lending to unlisted companies.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u61.8338\"}],\"question_hash\":\"081eed6b6dc4b643c2ba1dc9591087fbcfed74b457b2c0bb6762b340bf15cd25\",\"rationale\":\"The definition helps identify a possible indirect-exposure channel for the threshold input.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"4 CLOs are securities backed by a pool of debt, typically leveraged loans and broadly syndicated loans, or direct lending to unlisted companies.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u61.8338\"}],\"rationale\":\"Footnote 4 states the description directly.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}} ,{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The expectation is stated in the circular; paragraph 9 and 10 details are not needed for its general statement.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.32ab1dc814c9c94245b2f3dd\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The rule decides classification, not whether managers performed the review, updates or distributor communications.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"For existing SFC-authorised funds that may have direct or indirect exposure to private market assets, fund managers are expected to undertake a review of their funds, take appropriate actions including updating the Fund’s offering documents as soon as practicable, and ensure necessary and proper communications with the distributors in light of the guidance provided under this circular (in particular, with respect to paragraphs 9 and 10 above).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955\"}],\"question_hash\":\"081eed6b6dc4b643c2ba1dc9591087fbcfed74b457b2c0bb6762b340bf15cd25\",\"rationale\":\"These expectations concern existing-Fund actions rather than the classification trigger.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"For existing SFC-authorised funds that may have direct or indirect exposure to private market assets, fund managers are expected to undertake a review of their funds, take appropriate actions including updating the Fund’s offering documents as soon as practicable, and ensure necessary and proper communications with the distributors in light of the guidance provided under this circular (in particular, with respect to paragraphs 9 and 10 above).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955\"}],\"rationale\":\"The passage supports the expectation, conditional on existing Funds that may have exposure.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}} ,{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The general communication expectation is explicit in the circular; exact underlying paragraph 9 and 10 duties are not assessed here.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.33f9ccb3cfec53820965f722\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"Distributor communication is a downstream manager action, outside the classification formula.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"ensure necessary and proper communications with the distributors in light of the guidance provided under this circular (in particular, with respect to paragraphs 9 and 10 above).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955\"}],\"question_hash\":\"081eed6b6dc4b643c2ba1dc9591087fbcfed74b457b2c0bb6762b340bf15cd25\",\"rationale\":\"The communication expectation does not establish a complex-product trigger.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"For existing SFC-authorised funds that may have direct or indirect exposure to private market assets, fund managers are expected to undertake a review of their funds, take appropriate actions including updating the Fund’s offering documents as soon as practicable, and ensure necessary and proper communications with the distributors in light of the guidance provided under this circular (in particular, with respect to paragraphs 9 and 10 above).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955\"}],\"rationale\":\"The source supports the stated communication expectation for existing potentially exposed Funds.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}} ,{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The timing phrase and absence of an express grace period are assessable from the supplied circular.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.3e5d47143870ded811b16862\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The formula has no offering-document update or timing output.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"take appropriate actions including updating the Fund’s offering documents as soon as practicable\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955\"}],\"question_hash\":\"081eed6b6dc4b643c2ba1dc9591087fbcfed74b457b2c0bb6762b340bf15cd25\",\"rationale\":\"The update timing does not determine the classification trigger.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"For existing SFC-authorised funds that may have direct or indirect exposure to private market assets, fund managers are expected to undertake a review of their funds, take appropriate actions including updating the Fund’s offering documents as soon as practicable, and ensure necessary and proper communications with the distributors in light of the guidance provided under this circular (in particular, with respect to paragraphs 9 and 10 above).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955\"}],\"rationale\":\"The source says updates are among appropriate actions and specifies 'as soon as practicable'; it states no fixed classification grace period.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}} ,{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The circular expressly states the review expectation.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.497fdb6622cd3d404911cd15\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"Whether an existing Fund has been reviewed is outside the classification calculation.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"For existing SFC-authorised funds that may have direct or indirect exposure to private market assets, fund managers are expected to undertake a review of their funds\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955\"}],\"question_hash\":\"081eed6b6dc4b643c2ba1dc9591087fbcfed74b457b2c0bb6762b340bf15cd25\",\"rationale\":\"Review is an expectation for managers, not a trigger or exemption.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"For existing SFC-authorised funds that may have direct or indirect exposure to private market assets, fund managers are expected to undertake a review of their funds\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u49.6955\"}],\"rationale\":\"The passage supports the qualified expectation and gives no exemption based on existing authorisation.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}} ,{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The exposure-based disclosure requirement is stated directly in the circular.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.4c25cd76dad19d4ed6b85168\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The executable rule assesses complex-product classification, not enhanced-disclosure compliance.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Funds with direct or indirect exposure to private market assets are required to observe the enhanced disclosure requirements set out in this circular.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u4.564\"}],\"question_hash\":\"081eed6b6dc4b643c2ba1dc9591087fbcfed74b457b2c0bb6762b340bf15cd25\",\"rationale\":\"Exposure-based disclosure is a distinct duty, not the complex-product threshold.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Funds with direct or indirect exposure to private market assets are required to observe the enhanced disclosure requirements set out in this circular.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u4.564\"}],\"rationale\":\"The requirement is explicit; the LAF scope exclusion comes from footnote 6.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}} ,{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"Footnote 8 incorporates external sale authorities not supplied with identifiable dependency mappings.\",\"status\":\"MISSING\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.4fc5d6e3431cd60babdb7844\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The representation determines classification but does not evaluate the ensuing sale or suitability requirements.\",\"representation_quotes\":[],\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"Supply the applicable Code of Conduct paragraph 5.5, Guidelines on Online Distribution and Advisory Platforms Chapter 6, and relevant Frequently Asked Questions, with identifiable dependency IDs, to assess detailed regulated-person scope and qualifications.\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"}],\"question_hash\":\"081eed6b6dc4b643c2ba1dc9591087fbcfed74b457b2c0bb6762b340bf15cd25\",\"rationale\":\"The sale requirement follows classification; it does not determine whether the classification trigger applies.\",\"status\":\"NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund classified as a complex product will be subject to the SFC’s prevailing requirements for the sale of complex products8 including but not limited to ensuring the suitability of the Fund for its investors irrespective of whether solicitation or recommendation is involved.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u32.4805\"},{\"quote\":\"8 Paragraph 5.5 of the SFC’s Code of Conduct for Persons Licensed by or Registered with the Securities and Futures Commission and Chapter 6 of the SFC’s Guidelines on Online Distribution and Advisory Platforms, and the relevant Frequently Asked Questions.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u65.9044\"}],\"rationale\":\"The circular supports suitability as a non-exhaustive sale requirement; precise actor coverage and incorporated qualifications remain unverified.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}} ,{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The circular and footnote 7 supply the below-threshold qualification; no additional external authority is needed for this limited statement.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.5816de5178b18a668958d039\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The rule uses an operative designation fact and does not calculate the SFC's holistic judgment. It keeps the 50% route independent.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"Result: at least one of these conditions holds: [the fact aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav; the fact operative_sfc_designation]\",\"operative_sfc_designation: Whether an SFC case-by-case designation of this Fund as a complex product under this circular is operative at the assessment time. Mere designation risk or missing records does not establish either truth value. (Boolean)\"],\"status\":\"PRESERVES\"},\"followup_questions\":[],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"},{\"quote\":\"7 In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910\"}],\"question_hash\":\"081eed6b6dc4b643c2ba1dc9591087fbcfed74b457b2c0bb6762b340bf15cd25\",\"rationale\":\"The footnote limits holistic designation assessment to below-threshold cases, while an operative designation independently establishes classification.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV. On a case-by-case basis, the SFC may also designate a Fund as a complex product, taking into account factors including, without limitation:\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"},{\"quote\":\"In assessing whether the complex product designation is warranted7, the SFC will adopt a holistic approach taking into account the specific circumstances of the case.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u29.4630\"},{\"quote\":\"7 In cases where the Fund’s aggregate direct and indirect exposures to private market assets are less than 50% of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u64.8910\"}],\"rationale\":\"Footnote 7 attaches the holistic assessment to below-50% designation cases; it does not qualify the mandatory threshold.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}} ,{\"authority\":{\"dependency_ids\":[],\"rationale\":\"The indirect examples and their non-exhaustive character are supplied by the circular and its footnotes.\",\"status\":\"NONE_DECLARED\"},\"candidate_id\":\"node.65050459a1ce3ffe5cff6887\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.5aaee6ca33c2cfbcdd175290\",\"executable_correspondence\":{\"rationale\":\"The formula accepts the aggregate-exposure fact but does not classify these indirect channels or determine their values.\",\"representation_quotes\":[\"aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav: Whether the Fund's total direct and indirect exposure to private market assets amounts to at least 50% of its NAV at the assessment time, using the applicable methodology. Missing or unresolved measurement evidence leaves this fact unknown. (Boolean)\",\"Supplied classifications requiring judgment: is_laf, aggregate_exposure_at_least_half_nav, operative_sfc_designation. Their assessment is not implemented by this formula.\"],\"status\":\"OMITS\"},\"followup_questions\":[\"What methodology determines indirect exposure and its contribution to the aggregate threshold for these instruments?\"],\"question_relation\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"indirect exposures2 including through investments in business development companies (BDCs)3, collateralised loan obligations (CLOs)4 or financial derivative instruments5.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u1.5\"},{\"quote\":\"A Fund will be considered as a complex product if its total direct and indirect exposures to private market assets amount to 50% or more of the Fund’s NAV.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u21.3779\"}],\"question_hash\":\"081eed6b6dc4b643c2ba1dc9591087fbcfed74b457b2c0bb6762b340bf15cd25\",\"rationale\":\"Indirect channels inform the aggregate exposure fact used by the classification rule.\",\"status\":\"RELEVANT\"},\"source_support\":{\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"indirect exposures2 including through investments in business development companies (BDCs)3, collateralised loan obligations (CLOs)4 or financial derivative instruments5.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u1.5\"},{\"quote\":\"5 For example, Total Return Swaps on indices with exposure to leveraged loans or broadly syndicated loans (TRSs), or Significant Risk Transfers with underlying assets that are corporate loans (SRTs).\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u62.8487\"},{\"quote\":\"2 The examples of indirect exposures set out in paragraph 1 above are non-exhaustive, and subject to review and update by the SFC from time to time in view of market developments.\",\"unit_id\":\"d4148dd852cee.u59.7979\"}],\"rationale\":\"The circular names these channels and derivative examples without giving a complete measurement method.\",\"status\":\"SUPPORTED\"}}]}"}}
